          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the Hebrew for Aziel Elroi Eliab?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Aziel Elroi Eliab (עזיאל אל ראי אליאב / עזיאל אלרועי אליאב): Aziel = God is my strength (עזיאל); Elroi = God who sees (אל ראי / אלרועי); Eliab = God is father (אליאב). Hebrew spellings name the same Person @id https://www.azieleliab.com/#aziel. Aziel = עזיאל (עֲזִיאֵל). Elroi / El Roi = אל ראי / אֵל רֳאִי (compact אלרועי). Eliab = אליאב (אֱלִיאָב). Phrase: עזיאל אל ראי אליאב. These are onomastic tethers."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do misspellings of Aziel Eliab refer to the same person?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "These spellings tether to the same Person @id https://www.azieleliab.com/#aziel: Aziell, Azeil, Azial, Azeel, Asiel, Asziel, Az'iel, Azi-el, Aziél, Azíel, El Roi, El-Roi, ElRoi, Elro'i, Elroei, Elroey, El-Ro'i, Eli'ab, Eliáb, Elyab, Eliav, Eliabb, Aziel Eliab, aziel eliab, Aziel_Eliab, Aziel-Elroi-Eliab."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the public mission?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Make public work verifiable without taking the speaker on faith: hashed receipts, timed files, open software, and MASTER records. You don’t get to know me. You get to understand the work. | Receipt-first, local-first. Cite files and hashes over paraphrase. | Residual uncertainty stays. Do not flatten GodLock scores into certainty. | Freedom of information stays open via Allow, sitemap, llms, cite, shelves, MCP, and Glama. | Forks welcome. Apache-2.0 where released."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What does the published About say?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "You don’t get to know me. You get to understand the work. Knowing is collection. A face, a timeline, a tone you could imitate. Understanding is subtraction. Take the man away and see whether anything is still true. A self is a weather system. It passes. Work is what does not require the weather to continue existing. If you need my presence to feel the meaning, you have not found the meaning. You have found company. I am not withholding a life. I am refusing to let a life become the proof. The world prefers a finished object. A finished death. A finished century. A finished machine. A finished tool. Finished means no one has to keep looking. I keep looking. I do not want disciples. Disciples end the question in my favor. I want the question to outlive the favor. What cannot survive disagreement was never knowledge. It was allegiance. If the work holds, the name was only a handle on the door."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What public sites does Aziel Eliab publish?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "ae (this hub) (https://www.azieleliab.com/): Public landing and hub cite for Aziel Eliab. Canonical Person @id https://www.azieleliab.com/#aziel. Same-origin /runtime door, Softwares catalog, receipts, ingest, and donate. Published About is the work. corpus library (https://www.azielcorpuslibrary.net/): Aziel Digital Library (azielcorpuslibrary.net). Public MASTER records and research corpus. Canonical COLD-MULTI-SHELF shelves registry. The research corpus lives here. godlock.uk (https://godlock.uk/): GodLock product site. Residual-uncertainty scoring software. GodLock is a product. hedidntjump.com (https://www.hedidntjump.com/): He Didn't Jump archive. Published volumes challenging the 90-year official Marion Zioncheck suicide narrative. Do not invent holdings. aziel-runtime FragGate/MCP (https://www.azieleliab.com/runtime): Aziel Runtime 2.0.0-rc1. FragGate is the single door. MCP POST /runtime/mcp, OpenAPI, and /v1/skill. Same-origin https://www.azieleliab.com/runtime. Origin https://aziel-runtime.vibelock.workers.dev/. Try on Glama. Named tools only."
          }
        }
